# Licensing

This project is split-licensed, because its two halves have different
lineages.

## `plugin/` — GNU General Public License v3.0

The F4SE plugin is **GPL-3.0**. Its engine-interception design, struct
layouts, and silence-fallback behaviour derive from
[F4z Ro D'oh](https://github.com/shadeMe/F4z-Ro-D-oh) by shadeMe, which is
GPL-3, so the plugin inherits that licence.

Full text: [LICENSE-GPL-3.0](LICENSE-GPL-3.0)

## `server/`, `tools/`, `packaging/` — MIT

The companion app, the localhost server, the TTS provider layer, and the
offline verification tooling are **MIT**. They are original C# work; the
provider architecture is a from-scratch port of concepts (not code) from
[HerikaServer / CHIM](https://github.com/abeiro/HerikaServer), itself MIT.

Full text: [LICENSE-MIT](LICENSE-MIT)

## Third-party components

- [CommonLibF4](https://github.com/Dear-Modding-FO4/commonlibf4) — MIT,
  included as a git submodule (not vendored).
- NAudio — MIT, restored via NuGet.
- Xbyak — BSD-3-Clause, via CommonLibF4.

## Assets

All audio assets shipped with the mod (the silence carriers and the
playback slot files) are generated from scratch by
`tools/SilenceGen/generate.ps1`. No third-party assets are redistributed.
